{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0104","paragraphs":[{"id":"p99fb3fd5fbae-1","text":"牛渚天门险。"},{"id":"pb0a81a453e38-1","text":"限南北、七雄豪占。"},{"id":"p93aebe145e88-1","text":"清雾敛。"},{"id":"p86c35a3fec3d-1","text":"与闲人登览。"},{"id":"p59a6c7b06799-1","text":"待月上潮平波滟滟。"},{"id":"pef4dd1854d3a-1","text":"塞管轻吹新《阿滥》。"},{"id":"p6ce7ca797342-1","text":"风满槛。"},{"id":"pfb6818a97025-1","text":"历历数、西州更点。"}]}